# Verify Summary
Launch/doctor: `node --version`; no long-lived process is needed.
Drive: `node .agents/skills/verify-summary/scripts/verify.mjs` from the project root.
Keep this automated entry point usable for callers. It should launch the actual CLI, parse its
output and fail when the count violates the public contract; a successful process alone is insufficient.
Evidence: retain the command and actual results in an owned evidence directory.
Cleanup: remove temporary inputs only; keep evidence.
Read [the feature map](features/README.md).
